<http://data.silknow.org/object/a65bf741-d208-3411-ab84-92dec2addb4e/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/general-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Figured ground of pale rose silk brocaded in tinsel, tinsel wound on a silk core, and frisé silver yarn. Undulating floral vines intertwined with ribbons of lace pattern. Panel composed of a number of pieces, lined with grayish-blue silk cloth and edged with silver galloon. Spotted, very worn, holes. Extensively repaired with running stitch."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/a65bf741-d208-3411-ab84-92dec2addb4e> .

